# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent; `<-` binds its result) and ch. 7 (a dynamic's readers move in the tick it moves): the label reads the plain part beside the hold at the build and again when the hold moves.
test the_plain_part_is_read_again

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="more on 1")
    1: Ui.Label(text="10: 1")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="10: 2")
